## Original Content
В Евросоюзе в июле цены на автомобильное топливо и масла для личного транспорта выросли на 16,9% к июлю 2025 года, по данным Eurostat.

## Summary
According to Eurostat data, prices for automotive fuel and oils for personal transport in the European Union rose by 16.9% year-over-year in July. The increase reflects ongoing inflationary pressure on consumer energy costs in the EU.

## Key Points
- Automotive fuel and oil prices in the EU increased by 16.9% year-over-year in July
- The price growth is measured against July of the previous year
- Data source is Eurostat, the statistical office of the European Union
- The rise indicates continued inflationary pressure on transport-related consumer costs


